    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "Got you. So that does kind of underline the European nature of the Vatican. So let's talk on the other side of it, which is anti-Catholicism in the United States, and sort of how the Vatican looked at and dealt with the attitudes towards Catholicism in the United States. 19th century, even in the 20th century.",
