        "text": "Anti-Catholic sentiment existed in the United States during the 19th and 20th centuries.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The Vatican paid attention to and responded to anti-Catholic attitudes in the United States.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
