      },
      {
        "text": "The Vatican’s actions were influenced by external pressures, including anti-Catholicism in the U.S.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a meaningful contrast between Europe and the United States regarding Catholicism.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Historical analysis of the Vatican's foreign relations includes its responses to domestic opposition in non-European countries.",
        "confidence": 0.83
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that the listener understands the basic context of American anti-Catholicism.",
