    "turn_text": "He does. And so in the bully pulpit, for example, speaking up about the global war on terror, And while they did abhor war, there is a just war theory that they talk about, but they were more than glad to speak up to support the principle of reform of Islam and de-conflicting Islam. That was helpful. That was helpful to us. This was the time when Ahmadinejad was calling for blowing up Israel when I was serving over there, and the pope contested that quite vigorously consistently. So on the bully pulpit level, they can say a lot of things. privately, they have a unique role. They really can. We saw it with Obama's outreach to Cuba two years. Tell",
